========================================================================
  STEP 5 — tools/call get_requirement (REQ-003)
========================================================================
These acceptance criteria are what an agent would turn into a Gherkin scenario (BDD)
plus failing unit tests (TDD) — the spec (SDD) stays the source of truth.
JSON-RPC request: method="tools/call" params={"name":"get_requirement","arguments":{"id":"REQ-003"}}
Result:
    {
      "id": "REQ-003",
      "title": "Two numbers separated by a comma are summed",
      "status": "pending",
      "story": "As a user, I want comma-separated numbers to be summed so that I can add multiple values at once.",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "Given \"1,2\", when add is called, then the result is 3",
